name: "Quad (4.0)"
description: "Quadraphonic 4.0: front L/R at ±30 and surround Ls/Rs at ±110, no centre, no LFE (i.e. 5.1 minus C and LFE). BS.2051-clean positions; classic 1970s quadraphonic used a ±45/±135 corner square instead."
